{"ref":"BDB, חָרַק","hw":"חָרַק","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָרַק</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. gnash</strong> or <strong>grind</strong> the teeth, only poet. <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَرَقَ</span> <em>file, rub together, grate</em> or <em>grind</em> (teeth); Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܰܪܶܩ</span> <em>id.</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 16:9\" href=\"/Job.16.9\">Jb 16:9</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֲרֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:10\" href=\"/Psalms.112.10\">ψ 112:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחַרְקוּ־</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:16\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.16\">La 2:16</a>; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָרֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:16\" href=\"/Psalms.35.16\">ψ 35:16</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹרֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:12\" href=\"/Psalms.37.12\">ψ 37:12</a>;—<em>grind</em> the teeth in rage against: <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ שׁניו על</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:12\" href=\"/Psalms.37.12\">ψ 37:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:16\" href=\"/Psalms.35.16\">35:16</a>; abs. without <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:10\" href=\"/Psalms.112.10\">112:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:16\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.16\">La 2:16</a> (only here c. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁן</span> sing.); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> instr. (Ges<sup>§ 119. 3 b. R.</sup> Da<sup>Synt. § 73 R. 6</sup>) <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ בשׁניו על־</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 16:9\" href=\"/Job.16.9\">Jb 16:9</a>.","next":"BDB, חָרַר","prev":"BDB, חַרְצַנִּים²"}